  "ruleText": "He-W 734.03 Child Support. Arrearage in court-ordered child support shall not be cause for disqualification.\n\nSource. #6549, eff 8-1-97; ss by #8388, eff 7-8-05; ss by #10368, eff 7-8-13; ss by #13543, eff 1-28-23",
